            "content": "**PR hygiene — daily check (Mon–Fri 8:00 Prague)**\n\n1. Every open, non-draft PR must link an issue or be in the @appmixer-connectors project.\n2. Every project item **added in the last 2 days** must carry an `appmixer:<connector>` label or `non-connector-task`. The 2-day window keeps historical items out of the report.\n\nNothing is posted when both lists are empty."
